{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c1d3bf539d4931a9","name":"The InterGalactic Banking Clan","source":{"id":"source:reference-c1d3bf539d4931a9","title":"The InterGalactic Banking Clan","revision":23772,"timestamp":"2024-10-06T21:45:38Z","sha256":"d59582fcb5817d71ac3c4abc02a09100d6d925e8310b670bdcd09cd276d0bfb4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=23772","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20InterGalactic%20Banking%20Clan&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c1d3bf539d4931a9","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Based on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Muunilinst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Muunilinst","referenceId":"reference:0997a0b4702be63c"},", The InterGalactic Banking Clan supports ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Confederacy of Independent Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Confederacy_of_Independent_Systems","referenceId":"reference:dfc46c9d666b9b41"},"- but not exclusively. The enigmatic Chairman of the IGBC, ",{"tag":"a","children":["San Hill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/San_Hill?action=edit&redlink=1"},", feels that denying ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Republic","referenceId":"reference:332055cafc4223eb"}," the services provided by The InterGalactic Banking Clan- the administration of loans and interest rates, and the regulation of investment market prices- will only put the Republic in a position where it has no choice but to fight until the bitter end. If allowed to view the independent systems as friendly competitors, rather than enemies, the Republic will be much more willing to concede the war and let those systems secede, in order to preserve its own financial stability.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The IGBC's Collections and Security Division's primary purpose prior to the outset of the war is to collect overdue debts and provide security for IGBC facilities and the clan's officers. They are organized into two different groups: the organic Muun Guard and ",{"tag":"a","children":["IG-Series Lancer Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/IG-Series_Lancer_Droids"},", and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["IG-100 MagnaGuard"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/IG-100_MagnaGuard","referenceId":"reference:1e0287d8cb3bde5f"}," \"elites.\" The Muun Guard and ",{"tag":"a","children":["IG-Series Lancer Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/IG-Series_Lancer_Droid","referenceId":"reference:a600b0918aa75fa5"}," units are structured exactly the same way, while ",{"tag":"a","children":["IG-100 MagnaGuards"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/IG-100_MagnaGuards"}," are produced in such low numbers that they need no command structure; they merely follow the orders of their programmed masters.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Squad (9 soldiers):"]}," A Squad consists of 9 soldiers (",{"tag":"a","children":["Muun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Muun?action=edit&redlink=1"}," Guards or ",{"tag":"a","children":["IG-Series Lancer Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/IG-Series_Lancer_Droids"},"). Either type of group is led by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Muun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Muun?action=edit&redlink=1"}," Guard Sergeant."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Troop (45 soldiers):"]}," A Troop consists of 5 Squads, coordinated under a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Muun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Muun?action=edit&redlink=1"}," Guard Lieutenant."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Brigade (225 soldiers plus support personnel):"]}," A Brigade consists of 5 troops and a section of 5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["IG-227 ",{"tag":"i","children":["Hailfire"]},"-Class Droid Tanks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/IG-227_Hailfire-Class_Droid_Tanks"},", led by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Muun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Muun?action=edit&redlink=1"}," Guard Captain."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Division (1,125 soldiers plus support personnel):"]}," A Group consists of 5 Brigades, led by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Muun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Muun?action=edit&redlink=1"}," Guard Colonel."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
